The Game is a drama, thriller, mystery film directed by David Fincher.

3
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:36,000
In honor of his birthday, San Francisco banker Nicholas Van Orton, a financial genius and a cold-hearted loner, receives
an unusual present from his younger brother, Conrad: a gift certificate to play a unique kind of game.

4
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:46,000
In nary a nanosecond, Nicholas finds himself consumed by a dangerous set of ever-changing
rules, unable to distinguish where the charade ends and reality begins.

